Singing Voice Data Scaling-up:
An Introduction to ACE-Opencpop and ACE-KiSing
Jiatong Shi1,∗ , Yueqian Lin2,∗ , Xinyi Bai3,4 , Keyi Zhang, Yuning Wu5 , Yuxun Tang5 , Yifeng Yu6 , Qin
